{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "blender-mcp",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "displayName": "Blender 建模",
  "description": "装好 Blender 侧的 MCP addon 并注册连接，让 AI 能在 Blender 里建模型、改材质、导出 glb 回画布。需要 Blender 已经安装并手动开启 MCP 服务。",
  "kind": "stdio",
  "install": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "probe-uv",
        "type": "probe",
        "argv": ["uvx", "--version"]
      },
      {
        "id": "addon",
        "type": "exec",
        "argv": ["uvx", "mcp-for-blender@2.2.6", "install-addon", "--addons-dir", "{blender.addons}"]
      }
    ],
    "uninstall": []
  },
  "connect": {
    "transport": "stdio",
    "command": "uvx",
    "args": ["mcp-for-blender@2.2.6"],
    "env": ["BLENDER_HOST", "BLENDER_PORT"]
  },
  "requires": {
    "commands": ["uvx"],
    "platforms": ["win32", "darwin", "linux"]
  },
  "manual": [
    "打开 Blender，在 3D 视口侧栏找到 MCP 面板，点 Start Server",
    "默认端口 9876；改过端口就把 BLENDER_PORT 填成实际值"
  ]
}
